  "body": "### Summary\nAs a reader of a category's topic list, I want each row laid out as in the legacy app (pin and lock before the title, the page count, the last poster and date on the right, the whole row highlighted when unread), so that I read the list at a glance as before. The row also shows the wrong member today: the topic starter instead of the last poster.\n\nMilestone: **M4** (validated legacy parity, ROADMAP). Source: operator UI comparison of 2026-11-11, side-by-side simulator captures 06, 07 (pseudos redacted, attached below when available).\n\n### Observed (operator comparison, 2026-11-11, Catégories → Jeux Video, logged out)\n| | Legacy @ `87fe0d1c` | SwiftHFR @ `9e93c3eb` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Container | Inset card with separators | Full-width plain list |\n| Sticky / locked | Red pin and grey lock **before the title**, same line | Black pin and lock on the info line, hard to tell apart |\n| Info line | \"N pages\" leading; \"last poster - date\" **trailing** (relative when recent, short date otherwise) | \"starter · N réponses · relative date\", all leading |\n| Unread | Whole row highlighted | Blue dot (on every row when logged out) |\n\n**Data bug:** on sticky topics whose last post is old, the two apps show a different member. Legacy shows the author of the last post (`topic.aAuthorOfLastPost`, `HFRswift/Swift/MainWindow.swift:498`); SwiftHFR shows the starter (GAP-026: \"starter · replies · relative date\").\n\n### Scope\n- Row layout of `HFRswift/Swift/MainWindow.swift:440-520` @ `87fe0d1c`: pin (red) and lock before the title, \"N page(s)\" leading, \"<last poster> - <date>\" trailing, date format as legacy.\n- Unread: whole-row highlight as legacy, no dot. Logged out (nothing known as read): no unread mark.\n- Keep the poll mark of #584 if it is legacy's.\n- Same row wherever the legacy row is used (Favoris, topic lists, search results): check each.\n\n### Decision to record\nReopens GAP-026 / #584 for the row layout (operator, 2026-11-11: \"reprendre vraiment le style legacy pour le moment\"). Update GAP-026 through the `### Ledger` section of the fixing PR.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Side-by-side capture of the same list matches legacy row by row (light and dark).\n- [ ] The trailing name is the last poster on a sticky topic with an old last post (test on a fixture).\n- [ ] No unread dot; unread rows highlighted; nothing highlighted logged out.\n\nRelated: #572 (visual consistency umbrella), #584, #799.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
