   "body": "**Grouped work (operator rule, 2026-11-12): claim the group, fix it in one pass.** This issue is one of a group of near-duplicates that touch the same component. **Group L, list and table rows:** #817 (topic list rows) · #825 (table rows and chevrons).\n- Whoever claims one claims **every issue of the group**, with the same `/claim <id>` on each, and fixes them in **one PR** that names each (`Closes #817`, `Closes #825`).\n- The change lands in the one shared row component (or creates it), so it reaches every list that shows the row. That is the approach of #836.\n- If a member cannot be done in that pass, say why on it and keep it `Refs`; never fix one copy and leave the others.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
